# Menu Bar Icons (macOS 26+)

SwiftUI `Commands` menu items on macOS 26 **do** render SF Symbol icons. Use `Label` instead of plain strings:

```swift
// ✅ Icon renders in macOS 26 menu bar
Button {
    doSomething()
} label: {
    Label("My Action", systemImage: "star")
}

Toggle(isOn: $flag) {
    Label("My Toggle", systemImage: "gearshape")
}

Picker(selection: $value) {
    // ...
} label: {
    Label("My Picker", systemImage: "circle.lefthalf.filled")
}
```

This works for `Button`, `Toggle`, and `Picker` inside `CommandGroup`.
